    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Colleran Auctioneers is delighted to present 5 Ocean Towers to the market, a wonderful two-bedroom, ground-floor apartment. Perfectly positioned in the heart of the development, this rare property boasts a direct frontline position facing the iconic Salthill Promenade and the landmark Blackrock Diving Tower. \n\nUpon entering, a welcoming hallway leads to a bright and spacious L-shaped kitchen and living room. Bathed in natural light throughout the day thanks to its southerly aspect, this living space features a floor-to-ceiling patio door which opens to a private terraced patio, offering panoramic, uninterrupted views of Galway Bay and the vibrant energy of Blackrock. The accommodation is completed by two double bedrooms, including a main bedroom with a private ensuite, a bathroom, and highly practical storage and utility closets.\n\nOcean Towers itself is entered via a secure and key controlled gated entrance. Communal off-street parking is provided for residents and number 5 Ocean Towers benefits from parking spaces immediately adjacent to its front door, allowing for step free access. \n\nOcean Towers is managed Ocean Property Management and ensures that common areas, building structures, and grounds are exceptionally well-maintained. Adding this to its premier landmark location and exceptional views, this apartment will ideally suit those looking to downsize or retire as well as anyone seeking a holiday home in Galway`s most prestigious location. \n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch - 1.5m (4'11\") x 1.2m (3'11\")\nTiled with stained glass door to hall.\n\nEntrance Hall - 5.4m (17'9\") x 1.2m (3'11\")\nTiled with coat closet, utility closet and double door hot press.\n\nMain Bedroom - 4m (13'1\") x 3m (9'10\")\nWith built in wardrobe.\n\nEnsuite - 2.3m (7'7\") x 1m (3'3\")\nFully tiled with toilet, wash hand basin and shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.9m (12'10\") x 2.5m (8'2\")\nWith built in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - 2.9m (9'6\") x 1.9m (6'3\")\nFully tiled with toilet, wash hand basin, bath and shower.\n\nL shaped Kitchen/Living Room\n\nKitchen Area - 3.1m (10'2\") x 2.6m (8'6\")\nWith a generous range of cupboard space and tiled floor.\n\nLiving Area\nBright and spacious living area with timber floor, open fireplace and coving to ceiling. Sliding door to private terraced patio overlooking Blackrock.\n\nManagement Fee\n2,000.00 per annum approximately\n\nArea\n80.41 sqm / 865.52 sqft approximately\n\nParking\nCommunal off-street parking is provided for residents and number 5 Ocean Towers benefits from parking spaces immediately adjacent to its front door, allowing for step free access.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Where else would you want to live. </li><li> Ground floor, two bedroomed, sea front apartment in gated community. </li><li> Offers, easily the best views of Galway Bay & Blackrock diving board. </li><li> In need of modernisation but you won`t notice that because you will be looking at the view!!!!</li></ul>"
      },
